# Why: Why: Exercise the Shell-facing runtime SPI contract end to end,
including lifecycle, views, frames, input, platform messages, borrowed data,
stale scenes, and shutdown behavior. The suite also closes the report_error
seam semantics by stopping callbacks immediately, posting stop on the UI
runner, completing pending responses, and preserving single stop and destroy
calls. Link the explicit ShellTest fixture sources, fixture implementation,
and generated fixture assets so the test binary resolves without changing
production targets.
